s+='<section id="geometry"><h2>Actual mound geometry</h2>'+fig(A+'clay-low-angle.png','Untextured low-angle view · true proportions, no height exaggeration')+'<p>The deposits rise above the existing road and locally cover portions of cracks. The crack axes remain unchanged. Small grains follow the new surface.</p></section>'
